    "This project focuses on the implementation and analysis of a healthcare-related database system using SQL and Python. The primary objective is to translate a given relational schema—provided in the file **Schema_part1.PDF**—into a fully functional database. This schema, though not ideal in practice, has been designed for simplicity and instructional purposes.\n",
